L3233  - Inflation and economic concerns: Inflation continues to be a significant worry, with many citizens feeling the strain of rising prices on everyday goods and services.
L3234  - Government leadership and partisan cooperation: A significant number of Americans express dissatisfaction with government leadership and the perceived lack of bipartisan cooperation.
