L3366  
L3367  If you want to highlight a sweet gift for moms: Nothing sweeter than a mother's love --- except our pastries, maybe (40% off today!). Show her your love with a bundle of them.
L3368  
L3369  If you're looking for something a little cheeky: You're probably already Mom's favorite. Make sure of it with some scrumptious baked goods --- 40% off, just for today.
L3370  
